<title>USA: CBOE to list options on ING Groep NV.</title>
<headline>CBOE to list options on ING Groep NV.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board Options Exchange said it would begin trading options on Internationale Nederlanden Groep NV on June 23.</p>
<p>ING options will open with strike prices of 40, 45 and 50 and expirations in July, August, October and January.</p>
<p>Genesis Trading Group is the designated market maker.</p>
<p>ING Groep, based in the Netherlands, is a financial services company operating in 58 countries.</p>
<p>Chicago Derivatives Desk ((312-408-8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
